<title>USA: Continental Information names CFO.</title>
<headline>Continental Information names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Information Systems Corp said Tuesday it named Jonah Meer chief operating officer and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Continental Information said Meer joined it from Oppenheimer &amp; Co, where he was a senior vice-president.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
